  "description": "The central visual element is a human skeleton, likely of an adult, partially unearthed from soil. The skull, ribcage, spine, and limbs are visible, covered in dirt and sediment. The skeleton is positioned upright, suggesting it was buried in a standing or seated posture. The visual is stark and macabre, evoking themes of death, decay, and primitiveness. Its prominence and context are critical to the meme's message, as it is used as a visual metaphor for dehumanization.",
